      "text": "AI is changing education, but who’s protecting the data behind it?\n\nAt FLAsia 2026 in Singapore, one message stood out: as education franchisors increasingly adopt generative AI, data protection can no longer be an afterthought. With student, parent, franchisee, and financial data moving across locations and jurisdictions, organizations need to understand where their data goes and who remains responsible for it. Our latest blog explores the evolving data protection landscape and how education businesses can adopt AI while keeping sensitive data secure and under control.\n\nRead the full blog: https://lnkd.in/ggZ4DUMc",
