      "text": "Before investing in another AI solution, ask a few simple questions. Can your systems support it? Can your franchise data be trusted? Can different centres work from the same information? Can finance and operations work together seamlessly? AI is only as valuable as the operational foundation beneath it.\n \nWe'll be at FLAsia and in Singapore this week from 12th to 15th August. We would be happy to discuss what that foundation looks like.\n\n#ArtificialIntelligence #EducationFranchise #DataStrategy #DigitalTransformation #FLAsia",
