      "text": "We're heading to Singapore! ✈️ \n\nOur SVP – Business Operations, Janith Wimaladasa, will be in Singapore from 12th to 15th August and will also be attending FLAsia 2026. If you're interested in discussing how to create franchises that grow consistently, this is a great opportunity to connect.\n\nIf you're in Singapore, let's connect, whether at FLAsia 2026 or over a kopi to explore ideas, partnerships, and what's next.\n\nLooking forward to meaningful conversations in Singapore!\n\n#AzendTechnologies #FLAsia2026 #Singapore #Franchising #FranchiseTech",
