      "text": "Growth is exciting, until managing that growth starts becoming the biggest challenge.\n\nAs your education franchise grows, so does operational friction. More centres often mean more approvals, more spreadsheets, more reporting, and more manual work across your network. What starts as a few extra tasks can quickly become a barrier to growth. That's where the right technology makes the difference.\n\nAt Azend Technologies, we help education franchises simplify operations with connected systems that reduce manual effort, improve visibility, and make scaling far more manageable.\n\nBecause growing your network should feel exciting, not overwhelming.\n\n#EducationFranchise #OperationalExcellence #EdTech #Scalability #AzendTechnologies",
