      "text": "A resume opens the door. What builds a lasting career is More Than Just Your Resume.\n\nNo matter your role, the formula stays the same: Technical competence helps you deliver. People skills help you lead, grow, and belong.\n\nCareers don’t collapse because of lack of intelligence, they collapse because of miscommunication, ego, poor collaboration, and weak accountability. That’s why we don’t hire for skills alone. We hire for mindset, attitude, and growth potential. Because real success is sustainable, not situational.\n\n#AzendTechnologies #CareerGrowth #EmployerBranding #FutureReady #BalancedProfessionals",
