      "text": "Strong careers are built on two foundations: Capability: what you know and how well you perform. Character: how you behave, collaborate, and grow with others.\n\nAt Azend Technologies, we don’t just build systems, platforms, and solutions. We build people, professionals, and futures. If you believe growth comes from learning, accountability, adaptability, and excellence, you’ll belong here. This isn’t just a workplace. It’s a place to become more than your job title.\n\n#LifeAtAzend #AzendCareers #EmployerBranding #TalentDevelopment #FutureLeaders #WorkWithPurpose",
